/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          风味：‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          猕猴桃、樱桃、覆盆子、果汁感\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          Kiwifruit, Cherry, Raspberry, Juicy\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          这款驴子日晒，香气中带有淡淡的草莓，入口是具象的猕猴桃，整体是樱桃和蔓越莓的果酸，酸质虽然强度不高，但是非常活泼，非常有层次，果汁感强，喝完口腔中充满覆盆子般的回甘，触感顺滑，非常甜～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Sp7lWesudZDJpEbxUWBribqCncaEk99vEmzeTvDLuCU0JvLglHEILS8ibBwGPfdSSib5TIL6E0m0MZw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 799px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n         关于El Burro与本批次\n        </p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 13px;font-family: 微软雅黑;\">\n          Elida旗下分別有艾力达庄园(Elida Estate)、驴子庄园(El Burro Estate)以及路易多庄园(Luito Gesha Estate)，目前由第三以及第四代庄园主Wilford Lamastus和Wilford Lamastus Jr.所经营。本批次来自于驴子庄园，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-align: left;\">\n          海拔在1675米左右，发酵采取了120小时的鲜果封闭厌氧发酵，然后转到室外晒架自然晾晒干燥。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T8EI4V3Is2giakSbz5kluLCPuXNCuBibRPzYKpavUSPFqdSxxy6wseG7p1HNiaU6cUo438JoQAEPu6w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);outline: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于RFXD和TXD\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          这几年我们经常可以看到艾力达的批次上有这样的编码代号，就拿今年的四个批次来说我们有\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style='padding-left: 1.5em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;list-style-type: circle;'>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n             RF14D\n            </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n            蜜处理 ， 用定制的发酵反应器（\n            <span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n             Reactor Fermenter\n            </span>\n            即下图所示）发酵14天的蜜处理方式；同理如果看到RF6D 日晒，代表是鲜果在反应器里密封发酵6天，这个反应器可以接入co2，同时提供机械式的旋转功能使得发酵过程中人工可以旋转来达到内部鲜果或咖啡豆的均质效果（二氧化碳通常一天打入2次）\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n             T6D\n            </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n            ，传统日晒的方式，即非使用RF反应器的日晒处理\n           </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SbMs3hebVAJbfwjia9IdKY97icoPRqicjElcdFkGnZGItpSLBwXYWTWYUInAkOWTYKeIOFMwYlU0H8A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3GiaA4SENG1b6ha20QKPvOBwyyJJ75fCDknme2JvETaee3sZQOJb00dg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Sp7lWesudZDJpEbxUWBribqCpiad6x7qOfpBBcnBsvf7QibicQqpXFazJlgvb2iagaIefWhm4Ej7YVJRQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n            以下资料来自台湾守成 Haru Coffee\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-family: inherit;font-style: inherit;font-variant-caps: inherit;font-weight: 700;font-stretch: inherit;line-height: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;color: rgb(50, 50, 50);font-size: 14px;\">\n          巴拿马 拉马斯特家族　Panama Lamastus Family Estates\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          位于巴拿马，坐落于知名精品咖啡产区波魁特內的Lamastus家族，旗下分別有艾利达庄园(Elida Estate)、驴子庄园(El Burro Estate)以及路易多庄园(Luito Gesha Estate)三個带有各自特色的庄园，目前由第三以及第四代庄园主Wilford Lamastus和Wilford Lamastus Jr.所经营，Lamastus家族的咖啡世代至今已有百年的传承。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3UQsYs9nmfQvOwXxfm7MsnIqLLgoOFUTvb1Uf4tyAN3Um2wpr1J9Q9A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Wilford分享能够產出品质卓越的超級精品咖啡，要归功于以下的先天优越条件:\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          1.肥沃的火山土壤\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          2.微气候天气变化\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          3.高海拔种植环境\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          4.优良的原始森林\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          5.极具特色微批次\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-family: inherit;font-style: inherit;font-variant-caps: inherit;font-weight: 700;font-stretch: inherit;line-height: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;color: rgb(50, 50, 50);font-size: 14px;\">\n          巴拿马 驴子庄园　Panama El Burro Estate\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          驴子庄园，同样坐落在好山好水的波奎特产区，本区有超过一半的栽种面积包含在巴鲁火山国家公园，因此能够保有相当原始的生态环境；巴鲁火山是中美洲最高的火山之一，因海拔高度的差异，整个火山区更有高达7个以上的微型气候环境，驴子庄园的咖啡种植区块约落在1800米左右极高的海拔高度，气温够低，加上干燥季节仍有云雾缭绕，并且有原始林作为遮荫，夜间寒冷，咖啡櫻桃的熟成大约可延缓一个月左右，发展也更加完全。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Sp7lWesudZDJpEbxUWBribqucsDIWiakWOGqnKWc39mBpXQic1w84IloePJA7KAbFIicjNdpvdOicwfzw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆采购，请到淘宝或者有赞小程序\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          咖啡豆信息请参阅公众号文章菜单\n          <br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
